<title>MEXICO: Grupo Celanese sets payouts.</title>
<headline>Grupo Celanese sets payouts.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Celanese said on Friday it will pay a 0.45 peso ordinary cash dividend and a 0.35 peso extraordinary cash dividend on each of its Series B1 and Series B2 shares in circulation.</p>
<p>The payment will be made after April 28, the company said in a newspaper announcement.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
